    "burden_of_proof": "1. Purchase Order log with promised delivery dates.\n2. Supplier delivery confirmations (or evidence of late/missed delivery).\n3. Customs clearance documents (for imported materials/equipment).\n4. Site Diary noting work halted due to missing materials.\n5. TIA Report showing impact on dependent activities.\n6. Correspondence with supplier (escalation letters).\n7. Records of any alternative procurement (with cost differential)."
